--[[
    Roblox Enhanced — Aim Trainer
    Local-script executor module
    Features:
      · FOV circle & target line
      · Soft aim assist (mousemoverel)
      · Bot targeting (NPC Humanoids in workspace)
      · Hit-part selector (Head / UpperTorso / nearest)
      · Bullet prediction (velocity lead)
      · ESP (box, name, health bar) for players + bots
      · Target filters: distance, team, visibility, alive
      · Settings UI with keybinds
      · Server permission gate
]]

-- ── Services ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
